{"track":"r","category":"S3 클래스","level":2,"title":"S3 객체 만들기","desc":"<p>S3 클래스는 <b>리스트에 class 이름표</b>를 붙여 만들어요. <code>new_dog(name, age)</code>를 만드세요: <code>name</code>, <code>age</code>를 가진 리스트를 만들고 <code>class(obj) <- \"dog\"</code> 로 이름표를 붙여 돌려줘요.</p>","starter":"new_dog <- function(name, age) {\n  \n}\n","solution":"new_dog <- function(name, age) {\n  obj <- list(name = name, age = age)\n  class(obj) <- \"dog\"\n  obj\n}\n","hint":"<p><code>class(obj) <- \"dog\"</code> 로 이름표를 붙이고 <code>obj</code>를 돌려줘요. (또는 <code>structure(list(...), class = \"dog\")</code>)</p>","tests":[{"call":"class(new_dog(\"a\", 3))","expected":"dog","visible":true},{"call":"new_dog(\"a\", 3)$name","expected":"a","visible":true},{"call":"new_dog(\"b\", 5)$age","expected":5,"visible":false},{"call":"inherits(new_dog(\"c\", 1), \"dog\")","expected":true,"visible":false}],"id":"r-528"}